    "Each FBX carries a placeholder material slot named VolcanoKitV2Preview; replace it in the import settings or at runtime.",
    "All meshes are flat shaded (one colour per face in the bake) on purpose; do not enable \"calculate normals / smoothing angle\" on import.",
    "Triangle counts are the exported triangle totals per part; mobile frame rate was not measured."
